fn selfhost_private_effect_resource_graph_walker_unsupported_operation_count_loop %fn &SelfhostPrivateEffectResourceGraphWalkerInput fn SelfhostPrivateEffectResourceGraphWalkerBodyRecord fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 i32 \input\body\ordinal\idx\count:
