fn selfhost_private_effect_resource_graph_walker_has_unsupported_event_loop %fn &SelfhostPrivateEffectResourceGraphWalkerInput fn SelfhostPrivateEffectResourceGraphWalkerBodyRecord fn i32 bool \input\body\idx:
